                                "sense_id": "ac75c7ed-2879-385f-8618-2aa3e19b6450",
                                "text": "Owain Roberts, from Anglesey, was sent a bill for £4,300 by Vodafone. Roberts had logged on to his Vodafone account to report his phone as stolen, but was later told he had only managed to order a replacement phone as an upgrade."
                            },
