                                "sense_id": "ac75c7ed-2879-385f-8618-2aa3e19b6450",
                                "text": "At a subsequent meeting on Oct. 24, Wei Wai Kum Elected Chief Coun. Chris Roberts appeared as part of a delegation alongside We Wai Kai Elected Chief Coun. Ronnie Chickite, and said the comments were \"worrisome.\""
